        {
            "title": "川普稱伊朗支持的胡塞武裝請求美國不要下場",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 在伊朗支持的胡塞武裝與沙烏地的衝突惡化，加劇中東緊張局勢之際，美國總統唐納德·川普表示，胡塞武裝已請求美國不要襲擊該軍事組織。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">「胡塞武裝給我們打了電話，他們不想跟我們打仗，」川普周六在都柏林與愛爾蘭總理米哈爾·馬丁會晤期間對記者表示。「他們不希望我們對他們動手，」而且「他們非常希望我們不要下場」。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">當前，胡塞武裝與沙烏地支持的葉門部隊交戰越發激烈，包括襲擊該地區能源設施，以及向沙烏地西南部發射飛彈。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-265f1d53-72c8-3126-9bd3-ec37dc1f8703-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Axios引述兩名未具名美國官員報導稱，沙烏地王儲穆罕默德·本·薩勒曼周四兩次致電川普，要求他打擊胡塞武裝。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">推薦閱讀：沙烏地稱多個能源設施在襲擊發生後已暫停運行</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">川普證實了雙方已經交談，但未予詳述。「我跟穆罕默德·本·薩勒曼通了電話。他是我的一位好朋友，」 川普周六說。「我只能說一切都會順利解決。結果會非常好。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Trump Says Iran-Backed Houthis Asked US Not to Target Them</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%B7%9D%E6%99%AE%E7%A8%B1%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E7%9A%84%E8%83%A1%E5%A1%9E%E6%AD%A6%E8%A3%9D%E8%AB%8B%E6%B1%82%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%8B%E5%A0%B4-110908067.html",
